What is adapted from it here: the egress gate for the shared browser
(internal/controlplane/browser/egress/), from its server/browser/egress/gate.ts
and policy.ts and its electron/egress-addresses.mjs. Changed: written in Go in
place of Node, and only the rules of a self-hosted server are kept.

The shared browser's identity and its frame window (issue #540): what the
browser tells pages it is (internal/controlplane/browser/identity.go and
sidecar.go), from its server/browser/chrome/identity.ts, calibrate.ts,
flags.ts, wrapper.ts and sidecar.ts, and the two frames a view may have
unacknowledged (internal/controlplane/browser/view.go), from its
server/browser-live.ts. Changed: written in Go, one sidecar for the one shared
Chrome, the switches passed through agent-browser's AGENT_BROWSER_ARGS and the
time zone through its environment in place of a launcher script.

The web client's Team page (web/src/features/team/), from its team map:
src/components/TeamMapPage.tsx, TeamCanvas.tsx and ComputerNode.tsx, and
src/lib/team-map.ts, team-canvas.ts and team-canvas-computers.ts with their
tests. Changed: the Bots and the machines in two columns with no departments,
nothing dragged, a machine's live work in place of its screen, and the states
and edges worked out from Hypomnema's records; each file names what changed.

The built-in pages skill (internal/controlplane/clientcli/skills/pages/), from
its skills/data-dashboards at a6cd67c78610 (SKILL.md and dashboard.html, with
this LICENSE in the folder). Changed: shown with the show_artifact tool, no
public link, its data from Superset, and the template drawing its charts as SVG
with no library or network request.

An artifact page's policy (internal/controlplane/clientapi/artifacts.go,
pagePolicy, issue #737), from its shared/app-frame/csp.ts (BOT_HTML_CSP and
folderPageCsp), which web/src/features/artifacts sent as the frame's meta
until then. Changed: sent as the page's response header, its own files named
by the page's address, and no base.

